{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id32761493"}, "name":{"label":"Ryan Ilano"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-26T10:33:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"13444074320"}, "title":{"label":"Remember when podcasts were all audio?"}, "content":{"label":"Remember when podcasts were all audio? Overcast is a great app with a mid to late aughts chill internet vibe. I love being able To find and listen to 98% of the stuff I look for, even the obscure stuff, without dealing with Spotify, Apple, or Roku. I also love adding Patreon subscriber feeds before long trips and downloading everything. Overcast asks once, understands that YES I want to download 48 podcasts and it does it without flinching. Super great value and price, new features each year .", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
