{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id211597244"}, "name":{"label":"ryanbeattie.me"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-25T06:09:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"13439429610"}, "title":{"label":"Still number 1"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Overcast for more years than I can remember. Periodically I’ve tried other podcast apps, but Alicia come back to Overcast. \n\nI love the thoughtful features that I really can’t find anywhere else like “Smart Speed”. They updated the app after years, and yes there are some bugs, but the 1-star reviews are incredibly dramatic. This is a one man operation app and it literally doesn’t cost anything. Cut the guy some slack.. it’s still one of the best out there.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
